@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif

participant "macOS WindowServer" as WS
participant "WindowWatcher" as Watcher
participant "CascadeBarApp" as App
participant "WindowEngine" as Engine
participant "Target Window" as Window

== Layer 1: Structural Lifecycle Filtering ==
Window -> WS: Resized (User or Cascade)
WS -> Watcher: (Filtered out - kAXWindowResizedNotification eliminated)
note over Watcher: Ignores size adjustments;\nonly structural events (Create/Destroy/Min/Demin) trigger layout

== Layer 2: Debounced Asynchronous Suppression ==
Window -> WS: Window Created / Miniaturized
WS -> Watcher: Lifecycle Event
Watcher -> Watcher: scheduleDebouncedChange (350ms window)
Watcher -> App: windowWatcherDidDetectChange:
App -> Watcher: performWithoutTriggering:
activate Watcher
Watcher -> Watcher: isSuppressed = YES

== Layer 3: Idempotent Execution Guard ==
App -> Engine: cascadeWindowsOnScreens:... (restack: NO)
Engine -> Engine: calculateLayoutForWindows:
Engine -> Window: Read actualSize & currentFrame
alt |currentFrame - targetFrame| <= 1.0pt
    Engine -> Window: (No-op: AX calls bypassed, zero feedback events)
else |currentFrame - targetFrame| > 1.0pt
    Engine -> Window: Set kAXSizeAttribute & kAXPositionAttribute
end

Engine --> App: Layout complete
App --> Watcher: performWithoutTriggering block ends
Watcher -> Watcher: dispatch_after(500ms): isSuppressed = NO
deactivate Watcher

== Layer 4: Single-Instance Enforcement ==
actor User
User -> App: Launch second Cascade instance
App -> App: Check runningApplicationsWithBundleIdentifier:
App -> App: Duplicate PID detected -> Exit 0 immediately
@enduml
